OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 MAR
OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Sibelius
OL,5,     GKate Molleson charts the
OL,6,     Ginfluences upon the early
OL,7,     Gsymphonies of Sibelius, including
OL,8,     Gthe romantic symphonic music of
OL,9,     GTchaikovsky, and themes of
OL,10,     GNationalism.
OL,11,G1700FIn Tune
OL,12,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes
OL,13,     Gconductor Mark Elder and composer
OL,14,     Gand pianist Huw Watkins, and
OL,15,     Gthere's live music in the studio
OL,16,     Gfrom recorder ensemble Palisander.
OL,17,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,18,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,19,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
