OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 2 MAR
OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GSoweto's Flowers guest this week,
OL,6,     GChilean-born saxophonist Melissa
OL,7,     GAldana, shares some of the jazz
OL,8,     Gartists that she has been
OL,9,     Ginfluenced by.
OL,10,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,11,     GItalian baritone Andre Schuen and
OL,12,     Gpianist Daniel Heide give a
OL,13,     Grecital at the Schubertiade
OL,14,     GSchwarzenberg in Austria,
OL,15,     Gincluding Wagner's Wesendonck
OL,16,     GLieder and Strauss's Four Songs.
